{"height": 5, "weight": 92, "base_experience": 56, "ev_yield": [{"stat": "attack", "value": 1}], "genus": "Puppy Pokémon", "capture_rate": 190, "base_happiness": 70, "hatch_counter": 15, "growth_rate": "medium", "egg_groups": ["ground"], "gender_rate": 4, "names": [{"language": "ja-hrkt", "name": "イワンコ"}, {"language": "ja-roma", "name": "Iwanko"}, {"language": "ko", "name": "암멍이"}, {"language": "zh-hant", "name": "岩狗狗"}, {"language": "fr", "name": "Rocabot"}, {"language": "de", "name": "Wuffels"}, {"language": "es", "name": "Rockruff"}, {"language": "it", "name": "Rockruff"}, {"language": "ja", "name": "イワンコ"}, {"language": "zh-hans", "name": "岩狗狗"}, {"language": "es-419", "name": "Rockruff"}], "pokedex_entries": [{"versions": ["sun"], "text": "It’s considered to be a good Pokémon for beginners because of its friendliness, but its disposition grows rougher as it grows up."}, {"versions": ["moon"], "text": "This Pokémon has lived with people since times long ago. It can sense when its Trainer is in the dumps and will stick close by its Trainer’s side."}, {"versions": ["ultra-sun"], "text": "As they develop, their disposition grows more violent and aggressive. Many Trainers find them too much to handle and abandon them."}, {"versions": ["ultra-moon"], "text": "When it rubs the rocks on its neck against you, that’s proof of its love for you. However, the rocks are sharp, so the gesture is quite painful!"}, {"versions": ["sword"], "text": "This Pokémon can bond very strongly with its Trainer, but it also has a habit of biting. Raising a Rockruff for a long time can be challenging."}, {"versions": ["shield"], "text": "This Pokémon intimidates opponents by striking the ground with the rocks on its neck. The moment an opponent flinches, Rockruff attacks."}], "sprites_by_gen": {"generation-ix": {"scarlet-violet": {"normal": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-ix/scarlet-violet/744.png", "shiny": null}}, "generation-v